# Generated smoke/eval reports (regenerable; numbers drift with seeds)
**/reports/

# Eval-harness test results (generated on demand via the Download button; never committed)
ai_playgrounds/tests/results*.json

# Generated vector-store / index artifacts (rebuilt by the smoke pipeline)
ai_engineering/rag_assistant/index/

# Saved model artifacts (re-downloadable / re-trainable)
**/saved_models/

# ===========================================
# Local-only notes / scratch — NEVER published
# Put anything I don't want on GitHub in _local/ and it stays on my disk only.
# ===========================================
_local/